{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>中午12時許，藍田匯景花園15座一單位起火冒出濃煙，並傳出爆炸聲，警方接獲多名居民報案，消防到場將火救熄，單位嚴重熏黑，玻璃窗碎裂。事件中無人受傷，約50人自行疏散。經初步調查相信因陽光折射的熱力，點燃睡房內易燃物料。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.141957+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:02:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:42.057244+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:01.111264+00:00","content_hash":"1d95652cf49ceebb176e1d6e8313d930a3d83ca43593736f70166d6a2fae28e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}